  "title": "Chocolate Chip Marble Cookies",
  "description": "All my family and friends love my cookies I make. I thought I would try something different, so I made a marbled chocolate chip cookie. They came out GREAT!!",
  "authors": [
    "Debbie Cox"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-04-02T23:44:58-04:00",
